<title>SYRIA: Syria tenders to buy 12,000 tonnes rice.</title>
<headline>Syria tenders to buy 12,000 tonnes rice.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Foreign Trade Organisation for Chemicals and Foodstuffs (GEZA) on Tuesday issued an international tender to buy 12,000 tonnes of white rice for August delivery, a GEZA spokesman said.</p>
<p>He said that September 1 was set as final date to receive bids and that results would be announced on September 8.</p>
</text>
